      "Logistic Regression: 0.657 macro F1\n",
      "Each fold: [0.631 0.656 0.675 0.661 0.66 ]\n",
      "Linear SVM: 0.652 macro F1\n",
      "Each fold: [0.63  0.655 0.664 0.645 0.666]\n"
     ]
    }
